# StreamKDecompose can build a P >= num_cu wave decomposition rather than bailing),
# (2) has a ragged tail -- imbalance = ceil(grid/num_cu)*num_cu/grid >=
# 1.20 -- (3) has splittable K (gemmK >= 256), and
